    "d13cfdce-78c9-41f5-a236-84023b4e2610": {
      "type": "section__cta",
      "blocks": {
        "title_9Kera4": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "content": "OUR STORY",
            "textColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "fontFamily": "base",
            "fontSize": "medium"
          }
        },
        "275b3968-b115-4c92-a54c-822fd793b68c": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "content": "Minnesota Proud",
            "textColor": "#003e52",
            "fontFamily": "title",
            "fontSize": "big"
          }
        },
        "433fbdd3-f371-4ffc-a38e-f1050d3eee68": {
          "type": "richText",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "maxBWidth": 100,
            "content": "<p>It was a too-typical occurrence in 2020, when my wife Keavy and I tossed yet another pair of inadequate pillows into the closet.  Considering how important sleep is to us, there was clearly a disconnect with how we were buying bed pillows. If we were intent on achieving consistent, quality sleep, there had to be a better way than split second decisions at Target or Home Goods.</p><p>Not long after this we founded Lagoon, and began building the business from our home in Minneapolis. After a year of testing dozens of pillows, we went to work crafting our line of premium performance pillows designed to meet the needs of every type of sleeper.  We officially launched in August 2021, and have been delivering better sleep to those in our Minnesota community and across the country ever since.</p>",
            "detectLists": true,
            "textColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "fontFamily": "base",
            "fontSize": "base"
          }
        }
      },
