    "07d3ff1d-fee3-4e18-9556-f6cc3a6b2494": {
      "type": "section__image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14509331677313__07d3ff1d-fee3-4e18-9556-f6cc3a6b2494-title-1": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "content": "My Very Own Bed",
            "textColor": "#003e52",
            "fontFamily": "title",
            "fontSize": "medium"
          }
        },
        "template--14509331677313__07d3ff1d-fee3-4e18-9556-f6cc3a6b2494-richText-1": {
          "type": "richText",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "maxBWidth": 100,
            "content": "<p>We’re proud to have created our business here in Minnesota, and continue to find ways to make a positive impact on those in our community.  We’re partnered with the amazing Minneapolis-based charity, My Very Own Bed, which has donated over 5,000 beds and “Dream Kits” to children ages 2 - 17 in the Twin Cities and surrounding areas.  We donate our pillows to MVOB to include in their deliveries, and we help champion the importance of formulating good sleep habits at a young age. You can learn more about <a href=\"https://www.myveryownbed.org/\" title=\"https://www.myveryownbed.org/\">MVOB here.</a></p>",
            "detectLists": true,
            "textColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "fontFamily": "base",
            "fontSize": "base"
          }
        }
      },
