    "5a3df7bb-74f5-48c5-9db9-f6a82f45ec71": {
      "type": "section__cta",
      "blocks": {
        "title_UGaPYk": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "content": "OUR METHOD",
            "textColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "fontFamily": "base",
            "fontSize": "medium"
          }
        },
        "0f90e0e2-7025-4f93-b962-24b898ad4923": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "content": "Matching You with Your Perfect Pillow",
            "textColor": "#003e52",
            "fontFamily": "title",
            "fontSize": "big"
          }
        },
        "37b9aed2-cfa9-4895-ae4c-07b9eb6ab4dc": {
          "type": "richText",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "maxBWidth": 100,
            "content": "<p>It’s not just a quality pillow that we deliver, but the *right* pillow.  What makes Lagoon pillows so special is our ability to make sure it fits for you.  First, we offer the best sleep quiz out there, which perfectly matches people with the pillow that will be most comfortable for them, with over 95% accuracy.  From there, almost all of our pillows are adjustable, meaning that you will be able to add or remove fill until the pillow is actually a perfect fit, specifically for you.  This combination will allow you the greatest likelihood for optimal sleep.</p>",
